        <description>Offshore Waters Forecast for the Bering Sea

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...W wind 20 to 35 kt. Seas 11 to 19 ft.
.TONIGHT...NW wind 25 kt. Seas 8 to 13 ft.
.SUN...NW wind 25 kt. Seas 10 ft.
.SUN NIGHT...NW wind 25 kt. Seas 7 to 10 ft.
.MON THROUGH TUE...W wind 10 to 25 kt. Seas 4 to 9 ft.
.WED...E wind 10 to 20 kt. Seas 3 to 6 ft.
</description>
